WEBVTT

00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:30.167
and we could wrap it up there.

00:08:30.701 --> 00:08:31.851
(Applause)

00:08:31.875 --> 00:08:33.393
Hold on, we're not done.

00:08:33.417 --> 00:08:35.018
Not so fast.

00:08:35.042 --> 00:08:36.893
Because we're all human.

00:08:36.917 --> 00:08:39.518
And as a human, I always want more.

00:08:39.542 --> 00:08:42.226
And so now I want to think
about how to use chemistry

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.500
to extract more out of a device.

00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:49.809
Right now, we're being told
that we want something called 5G,

00:08:49.833 --> 00:08:52.625
or the promised
fifth generation of wireless.

00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:55.559
Now, you might have heard of 5G

00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:57.625
in commercials
that are starting to appear.

00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:00.684
Or maybe some of you even experienced it